<title>FRANCE: EU CUTS HIGH-QUALITY WHEAT DUTY TO 7.84 ECUS.</title>
<headline>EU CUTS HIGH-QUALITY WHEAT DUTY TO 7.84 ECUS.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union on Friday cut its import tariff for high-quality wheat from distant origins to 7.84 Ecus per tonne from 12.98 Ecus, grain trade sources said.</p>
<p>EU tariff changes are effective the following day.</p>
</text>
